  "overview": "Dr. Duncan is a Professor in the Department of Medicine, Division of Pulmonary, Allergy, and Critical Care Medicine.  He attended medical school at the University of Washington (Seattle) and served as a Medical Intern and Resident there.  His subsequent clinical and research training fellowships were at the University of Pittsburgh, Stanford University, and The Scripps Research Institute.  Dr. Duncan has had prior faculty appointments at Stanford University and the University of Pittsburgh.",
